{"id": "9c11cdab-163f-442d-a430-a9c402d43ae8", "query": "Tischleuchte schwarz", "category": "FACET_EXTRACTION", "language": "de", "severity": "MINOR", "failure_mode": "FACET_NOT_EXTRACTED", "evidence": "The query 'Tischleuchte schwarz' contains two distinct signals: a product type ('Tischleuchte') and a colour filter ('schwarz'). The engine partially honoured the colour constraint but failed to use it as a hard ranking signal. Most critically, the Flos Tischleuchte Lampadina in Orange (rank #6, relevance 0.504) appeared in the results despite the customer explicitly asking for black — a direct colour constraint violation. Meanwhile, the three highest-relevance black table lamps were displaced: Flos Tischleuchte Lampadina Schwarz (relevance 0.926) sat at rank #5, Anglepoise Mini Typ 75 Schwarz (0.922) at rank #8, and Wastberg+ w227 b Schwarz (0.922) at rank #12. The engine ranked the Mawa Stuttgart 2 Tiefschwarz (0.910) at #1 and #2 — not wrong products, but lower-scoring ones — while the best matches were buried. The relevance gap between the best available result and the customer's actual #1 is only 0.016 (0.926 vs 0.910), meaning the customer's first result was itself on-topic and near-best. The primary defect is that 'schwarz' was treated as a keyword to match in product titles rather than being extracted as a colour facet filter, which allowed the orange variant to surface and prevented strict colour-first ranking.", "recommended_fix": "Implement colour facet extraction from free-text queries. When the engine detects a known colour term ('schwarz', 'weiß', 'rot', etc.) in a query alongside a product-type noun, it should: (1) apply the colour as a hard filter — products with a different colour explicitly stated in their title or colour attribute (e.g. 'Orange') must be excluded or ranked last, not surfaced at rank #6; (2) boost products whose structured colour attribute matches the extracted colour value, rather than relying solely on keyword overlap in the title. Concretely: maintain a colour synonym dictionary that maps 'schwarz' to all black-family values ('Schwarz', 'Tiefschwarz', 'Mattschwarz', 'Graphitschwarz', 'RAL 9005', 'RAL 9011') so that products like Anglepoise Mattschwarz and Mawa Tiefschwarz are treated as colour matches. Products with no colour attribute and no colour keyword in the title (e.g. Fritz Hansen Kaiser idell 6556 at rank #10, Midgard Federzug-Tischleuchte at rank #11) should rank below confirmed colour matches. The orange variant should be demoted to last position or filtered out entirely. This change alone would surface the three 0.92+ relevance black table lamps into the top three positions.", "embedding": [-0.020091332495212555, -0.0017343413783237338, -0.010135761462152004, 0.03063252381980419, 0.015316261909902096, -0.017748843878507614, -0.03225424513220787, -0.02883060835301876, -0.023965444415807724, -0.06054427847266197, 0.04198457673192024, 0.02486640214920044, -0.0677519366145134, -0.021352671086788177, -0.042164769023656845, 0.010766430757939816, -0.027569269761443138, -0.019911140203475952, -0.011892626993358135, -0.023605061694979668, -0.01297377422451973, 0.022523915395140648, -0.0508139505982399, -0.004662449937313795, 0.025226783007383347, -0.00878432672470808, 0.021803149953484535, -0.08180685341358185, -0.04252514988183975, -0.027028696611523628, -0.015586549416184425, -0.02540697529911995, 0.01639740914106369, -0.03549768775701523, 0.0016217217780649662, -0.007117556408047676, -0.0016217217780649662, -0.031353287398815155, 0.007387843448668718, 0.013153965584933758, 0.012072818353772163, -0.026668313890695572, 0.039281707257032394, -0.0016892935382202268, 0.006126504857093096, 0.009640234522521496, -0.05982351303100586, 0.013694539666175842, -0.025046592578291893, 0.04414687305688858, 0.0015428881160914898, 0.08036532998085022, 0.010180809535086155, -0.046128977090120316, -0.016217218711972237, 0.042164769023656845, 0.004482259042561054, -0.03171367198228836, 0.0074779391288757