{"id": "27846acf-af2d-4a62-8f31-14a302c189ab", "query": "Kinderkleidung nicht synthetisch", "category": "NEGATIVE_INTENT", "language": "de", "severity": "CRITICAL", "failure_mode": "ZERO_RESULTS_OR_GARBAGE", "evidence": "The query 'Kinderkleidung nicht synthetisch' (children's clothing not synthetic) returned zero results. The customer asked for a clearly defined product category — children's clothing — with a material exclusion (no synthetic fabrics). Both parts of this query are entirely reasonable: children's clothing is a standard catalogue category, and natural-material children's clothing (cotton, wool, linen) is a common product type. The engine returned nothing at all, meaning the customer was shown a blank page. Max relevance score is 0.000, top-3 average is 0.000, and total results is 0. The engine almost certainly failed because it attempted to parse 'nicht synthetisch' as a keyword match requirement and found no product titles containing the word 'synthetisch' — a material descriptor that appears in exclusion context, not in product titles. The base query 'Kinderkleidung' alone should have returned a full page of children's clothing results, but the presence of the negation phrase caused the entire query to collapse to zero results.", "recommended_fix": "1. Implement negation/exclusion parsing at query time: detect German negation patterns — 'nicht [term]', 'ohne [term]', 'kein/keine [term]' — and split the query into (a) a positive search component and (b) a hard exclusion filter. For this query, 'Kinderkleidung' becomes the positive search term (mapped to the children's clothing category), and 'synthetisch' becomes a must_not filter applied against a material facet (e.g. material values containing 'Polyester', 'Nylon', 'Acryl', 'Polyamid', 'Elasthan', 'Kunstfaser'). 2. Map 'synthetisch' to a controlled vocabulary of synthetic material values in your product catalogue. Since product titles rarely contain the word 'synthetisch', the exclusion must operate on a structured material attribute/facet, not on title keyword matching. Build a synonym/expansion list: synthetisch → [Polyester, Nylon, Acryl, Polyamid, Elasthan, Kunstfaser, Fleece (synthetic)]. 3. Ensure the fallback behaviour when a negation term cannot be resolved is to return the positive query results (children's clothing) rather than zero results. A graceful degradation — showing children's clothing with a banner 'We filtered for natural materials where possible' — is far better than a blank page. 4. Apply the same fix to the analogous calibration cases already identified in this audit ('Tasche nicht Leder', 'Gartenleuchte nicht solar', 'Wein ohne Alkohol') — this is a systemic negation-handling gap across the entire search engine.", "embedding": [-0.00553597928956151, -0.01750507391989231, -0.02590750716626644, 0.0002516354143153876, 0.053215425461530685, -0.017855174839496613, 0.006651928182691336, -0.061617858707904816, -0.026082558557391167, 0.020743511617183685, 0.06756958365440369, 0.03798601031303406, -0.08822557330131531, -0.01680487021803856, -0.01838032715022564, 0.0046169632114470005, -0.04901420697569847, 0.0731712058186531, -0.015229413285851479, 0.049714405089616776, 0.009233926422894001, 0.022318968549370766, -0.044112786650657654, 0.030458826571702957, 0.02056846022605896, -0.0016520413337275386, -0.008358672261238098, -0.0717708021402359, -0.022231444716453552, -0.01776764914393425, 0.04516308754682541, -0.05146491155028343, -0.013303856365382671, -0.05776674300432205, -0.021793818101286888, -0.05461582913994789, -0.005098352674394846, -0.031684182584285736, 0.03763590753078461, 0.0031727945897728205, 0.013741482980549335, -0.03501014783978462, 0.02214391715824604, 0.03273448720574379, -0.032559435814619064, -0.0074396561831235886, -0.00905887596309185, 0.004901420325040817, -0.02748296596109867, 0.02958357334136963, -0.011640873737633228, 0.05426572635769844, 0.023281747475266457, -0.03641055151820183, -0.007658469490706921, 0.0294085238